          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            The best countertop ice maker for most people is the <strong class="text-white">GE Profile Opal 2.0 Ultra</strong>, which combines the highest rated output in GE's nugget line with a scale-inhibiting filter. Choose the <strong class="text-white">Frigidaire EFIC255</strong> for more nugget ice per day, the <strong class="text-white">Igloo ICEB26</strong> for cheap bullet ice, and <strong class="text-white">Newair's clear ice maker</strong> for cocktails.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Whichever you buy, use filtered water, keep the vents clear and clean the machine on schedule. Those habits matter more to ice quality and machine life than any feature on the box.
          </p>
